{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01932","headline":"杂曲歌辞 乐府 · 顾况","name":"杂曲歌辞 乐府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖谷春光至，宸游近甸荣。\n云随天仗转，风入御帘轻。\n翠盖浮佳气，朱楼倚太清。\n朝臣冠劒退，宫女管弦迎。\n细草承雕辇，繁花入幔城。\n文房开圣藻，武卫宿天营。\n玉醴随觞至，铜壶逐漏行。\n五星含土德，万姓彻中声。\n亲祀先崇典，躬推示劝耕。\n国风新正乐，农器近消兵。\n道德关河固，刑章日月明。\n野人同鸟兽，率舞感升平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}